# Copy resources

Ordinary wording lives in `src/mouse_click_stability_analyzer/resources/strings/`.

## Copy-only task

May edit `resources/strings/**`. Must not edit Python. Must not rename JSON keys or placeholders.

## UI-layout task

May edit Qt layout/style. Must not edit `resources/strings/**` unless explicitly requested.

## Terminology task

Do not consolidate or populate `terminology.json` until Stage 2.

## Report

HTML/XLSX labels are `report.json` English only. Do not invent Chinese report copy.
